WEBVTT

00:07:56.469 --> 00:08:00.429
you could actually use it
to run your Prius,

00:08:00.453 --> 00:08:03.797
which is kind of my dream --
to be able to drive a virus-powered car.

00:08:03.821 --> 00:08:04.938
(Laughter)

00:08:04.962 --> 00:08:09.676
But basically you can pull
one out of a billion,

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.618
and make lots of amplifications to it.

00:08:11.642 --> 00:08:13.915
Basically, you make
an amplification in the lab,

00:08:13.939 --> 00:08:17.233
and then you get it to self-assemble
into a structure like a battery.

00:08:17.257 --> 00:08:19.523
We're able to do this also with catalysis.

00:08:19.547 --> 00:08:23.478
This is the example
of a photocatalytic splitting of water.

00:08:23.502 --> 00:08:26.490
And what we've been able to do
is engineer a virus

00:08:26.514 --> 00:08:28.800
to basically take dye-absorbing molecules

00:08:28.824 --> 00:08:30.879
and line them up
on the surface of the virus